+     Administration group. Holds what shipped a day earlier as a block on the
+     System page - the resolver health check (rc/rdnshc.c) and the three
+     dnsmasq switches (strict upstream order, EDNS Client Subnet, no router
+     cache) - on its own native page: a live state strip that ARMS while the
+     watched server is down, the check's fields in one card, one card per
